sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen
    participant Client as Browser / Client (TrackStatus)
    participant TrackAPI as Next.js API (/api/applications/track)
    participant Security as Captcha Validator
    participant Prisma as Prisma Client (lib/prisma.ts)
    participant DB as Database (Application/History)
    participant IndiaPost as India Post Tracking API

    Citizen->>Client: Enter ARN, DOB, and Captcha
    Client->>TrackAPI: GET /api/applications/track?arn=...&dob=...
    activate TrackAPI

    TrackAPI->>Security: verifyCaptcha(token)
    alt Invalid Captcha
        Security-->>TrackAPI: Fail
        TrackAPI-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
        Client-->>Citizen: Show Captcha Error
    else Valid Captcha
        Security-->>TrackAPI: Pass
    end

    TrackAPI->>Prisma: Query Application with relations
    activate Prisma
    Prisma->>DB: SELECT Application, StatusHistory, Passport
    DB-->>Prisma: Application data
    Prisma-->>TrackAPI: Records
    deactivate Prisma

    alt Application Not Found
        TrackAPI-->>Client: 404 Not Found
        Client-->>Citizen: Show Application Not Found
    else Application Located
        TrackAPI->>TrackAPI: Map status to milestone stage (1-5)

        opt Dispatched / In Transit
            TrackAPI->>IndiaPost: Fetch consignment status (Speed Post tracking)
            IndiaPost-->>TrackAPI: Live postal transit details
        end

        TrackAPI-->>Client: 200 OK { currentStatus, stage, timeline, postalDetails }
        deactivate TrackAPI

        Client-->>Citizen: Render visual timeline with milestones & postal status
    end
